==Battleground==
*3 [[Pigge]]s (2,400%) spawn, delay 29.33~30 seconds<sup>880f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigge]]s (2,400%) spawn after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>, delay 29.33~30 seconds<sup>880f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] (2,400%) spawns after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] (2,400%) spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Pigge]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Capy|Capies]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[J.K. Bun Bun]]s spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You're already running a lot of meatshields in Baron Seal's stages, so the Capy has little opportunity to do anything. The J.K. Bun Bun is also at a relatively low magnification, so it's easy prey for your Ubers. While slow to beat, it's nothing really challenging whatsoever.

